{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28945-kickstarter-s-over-how-did-it-go","id":28945,"title":"Kickstarter's over! How did it go?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-12T14:48:12-08:00","id":28945,"title":"Kickstarter's over! How did it go?","content":"So, the Kickstarter is finished. It was the first Kickstarter I was able to fund and I'm pretty excited. The book itself is awesome and all that extra stuff we obtained through the stretch goals is just great. What are your opinions?<br /> <br /> Now that's finished, how did it go? I ask because, aside from Demon, the only other Kickstarter I'm familiar with is the Exalted KS and I don't think that one, with its huge amount of money, is really helpful to set a proper term of comparison...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T14:56:13-08:00","id":28951,"title":"","content":"$150,235. Plus this update: <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition/posts/692712\" target=\"_blank\">Update #34 </a><br /> Dec 12, 2013<br /> <b><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition/posts/692712\" target=\"_blank\">What A Great Fall It Has Been!</a></b><br /><br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition/posts/692712#comments\" target=\"_blank\">4 comments</a> <br /> <br /> <br /> 14 likes<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Rose here. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Wow! After a month, the <b>Demon: The Descent Prestige Edition</b> Kickstarter campaign has closed... and what a campaign it's been! Thanks to you, we not only funded the <b>Prestige Edition of Demon: The Descent</b>, but smashed our stretch goals. <br /> To recap, here's what you're enabling us to do: <br /> * Add a ribbon bookmark to the core book. <br /> * Create the <b>Seattle </b>sourcebook. <br /> * Create the <b>Demon Seed Collection</b>, with five adventures, each in a separate exciting location. (Two of which will be picked by our Global Operative backers.) <br /> * Create <b>Heirs to Hell</b>, a mini-supplement detailing the children of demons. <br /> * Create <b>Demon Condition Cards</b>, covering the core Conditions introduced in <b>The God-Machine Chronicle</b> along with the new Conditions from <b>Demon</b>. <br /> * Create the <b>Demon Anthology</b>, a short story collection with <b>8 </b>all-new stories. <br /> * Create the <b>Demon Anthology Interface</b>, adding 2,000 words of setting or mechanical content to flesh out each story in the Anthology <br /> * Offer backers a discount on a Print on Demand copy of <b>Demon</b>. <br /> The books will be given in PDF to everyone who pledged for a <b>Demon </b>core book PDF or better. The cards will be given in PDF, with a discount for buying them in Print on Demand, to everyone who pledged for a <b>Demon </b>PDF or better. The Print on Demand discounts on <b>Demon </b>and <b>GMC </b>will be given to everyone who pledged for a physical <b>Demon </b>core book or better. <br /> The <b>Demon: The Descent </b>core book is currently undergoing approvals at CCP, after which we'll begin readying it to send to you in PDF and to the printers for the PoD and Prestige editions. We'll keep you posted on its progress with more updates like this one. I can't wait to put it in your hands. <br /> This has been an amazing month. <br /> Thank you for your support, and also for your input, which directly resulted in <b>Heirs to Hell</b> and <b>Interface</b>. We couldn't be happier to be bringing this game to you.<br /> RichT here- Just to echo Rose's voice of appreciation for the great KS you all made possible, and for the awesome projects we can now do thanks to you!<br /> We'll be sending out the official KS Surveys for your shipping info, names for in the backers' credits, Add-on choices, etc at some point soon, but now- we all need to rest and wait for Amazon Payments to do their thing.<br /> Expect a new Update in about 2 weeks!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T15:10:44-08:00","id":28957,"title":"","content":"There's also the Ready-Made PC's, which don't seem to be listed in the stuff in that post. But wow, that's an awesome achievement - so happy this awesome game got funded to that extent!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T15:37:48-08:00","id":28967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>strider1276</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28945-kickstarter-s-over-how-did-it-go?p=28957#post28957\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's also the Ready-Made PC's, which don't seem to be listed in the stuff in that post.</div> </div> </div> </div> Oops. Yes, there are RMPCs, too!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},